  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You charge with allies into battle without impediment.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Coordinated Charge<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When an ally with this feat charges a creature that is no further away from you than your (or your mount’s) speed, you can charge that creature as an immediate action. You may move through allies’ squares and ignore difficult terrain with this charge. If you expend one use of mythic power, you can use this feat against a target whose distance from you is up to twice your (or your mount’s) speed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-teamwork-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
